== Crestview Pool schedule_changes "Drop-in schedule - swim and aquafitness"
- IGNORED date-context "Monday, August 3"
    at: group "Drop-in schedule - swim and aquafitness"
- NOTICE "See Civic Holiday schedule."
    date text: "Monday, August 3"
    dates: 2026-08-03 Mon
    effects: see-schedule "Civic Holiday schedule"
    match: SCOPE_PHRASE
    at: group "Drop-in schedule - swim and aquafitness"

== Crestview Pool special_hours
- NOTICE "Regular season, June 26 to August 31"
    date text: "June 26 to August 31"
    dates: 2026-06-26 Fri to 2026-08-31 Mon
    effects: seasonal-hours
    match: SCOPE_PHRASE
    phrase: "Regular season"
    at: facility
- IGNORED heading "Civic Holiday"
    section: "Civic Holiday"
    at: facility
- NOTICE "Monday, August 3, 11 am to 1 pm"
    section: "Civic Holiday"
    date text: "Monday, August 3"
    dates: 2026-08-03 Mon
    time: "11 am to 1 pm" 11:00-13:00 unchecked
    ambiguities: possible-activity-time
    at: facility
